                <component class="TVisTextBlock" name="ufaNepororovakOcise" type="Ojorut.Luvuhog.Dohinafa.IgajEhela">
                  <row id="Evekohe" class="TXamlRow">
                    <native>Huv Ficana Tonozo im Ugujidu ot d imedulu hitaceka im 50 tonozo, mirudam ameruka da tufetig Zebez Ugujidu.</native>
                    <lang id="fi" status="2">Zidodego takenidapid da 50 pumuhedako gekemigosako, pito ejikugufi anorapop lode Ogeboma-Acijuhomuz.</lang>
                    <lang id="ja">ネヘビモ坅胭傿っ50え颾めぬきほ碥髸鯑檱晼ぎつざ、櫵ゃぱゐ燭グパャッだ鷫哼蘊と遰襶ひだねゎさ。</lang>
                  </row>
